      "functionality": "Powers the `webpushd` system daemon to inspect Home Screen WebClips (`UIWebClip`), configure notification icons/settings (`UNNotificationIcon`), and launch web apps in background (`FBSOpenApplicationOptions`, `SBSCreateOpenApplicationService`).",
