      "feature_category": "Privacy, Tracking Prevention, Content Filtering & Safe Browsing",
      "functionality": "Configures Advanced Privacy Protections, iCloud Private Relay fail-closed behavior, Private Access Tokens, and tracker blocking on `NSURLRequest`.",
